Package: libexiv2-28
Version: @DEB_EXIV2_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://exiv2.org/
Depends: libpng16-16
Description: Exiv2 image metadata library for the Xios desktop
 Runtime library for reading and writing Exif/IPTC metadata. This first Xios
 build keeps the library narrow for Gwenview and disables the command-line
 tools, tests, NLS, XMP, video, Brotli, and webready support.
